  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Rate of volume flow&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ℓ</mi></math>/min</p><p>&nbsp;</p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>600</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><p>Reynolds number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">η</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>600</mn><msup><mi>πr</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p>",
